Installing Cosign
------------
wget -O /usr/local/bin/cosign https://github.com/sigstore/cosign/releases/download/v2.6.1/cosign-linux-amd64 && chmod +x /usr/local/bin/cosign

cosign version

setting up Git configuration
--------
git config --global user.email "root@gitlab-ce-fmx9i8k5.lab.practical-devsecops.training"
git config --global user.name "root"

Generating the Key Pair
----------
cosign generate-key-pair

Loginto git lab
with root and pdso-training

Create a GitLab Project
----
cmcp-expenseapprover

create variables under settings -->cicd
Variable Key	Variable Value	Type
COSIGN_PRIVATE_KEY	(paste the full content of cosign.key)	File
COSIGN_PUBLIC_KEY	(paste the full content of cosign.pub)	File
COSIGN_PASSWORD	pdso-training	Variable

